SUMMARY:Water Lines: Architecture at the Edge Exhibition Opens
LOCATION:MIT\, 77 Massachusetts Ave\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:Through a selection of MIT student thesis drawings\, Water Line
 s: Architecture at the Edge explores how aspiring architects have approach
 ed the unique challenges and opportunities of designing in waterfront zone
 s\, and how architectural design has responded to shifting social prioriti
 es and environmental challenges over 150 years.\nhttps://calendar.mit.edu/
 event/water-lines-architecture-at-the-edge-exhibition-opens\nFrom Pushpin 
 Boston: https://pushpin.city/
